Package: nglscenes
Title: Generate and Manipulate Neuroglancer Scenes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Philipp", "Schlegel", email = "pms70@cam.ac.uk",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Construct, parse, edit and combine 'neuroglancer' scenes
    (viewer states). Scenes can be read from URLs (including state servers),
    JSON strings, files or the clipboard; layers, segments, colours and
    annotations can be manipulated; and scenes can be written back to URLs,
    JSON, files or the clipboard. Also creates 'neuroglancer' segment
    properties. R port of the core of the Python package 'nglscenes'.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/schlegelp/nglscenes-r,
    https://schlegelp.github.io/nglscenes-r/
BugReports: https://github.com/schlegelp/nglscenes-r/issues
